{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1000_028ari", "source_sha256": "7b8ff820c37855105a74da5cafc52c34d09ca280c9b0c997c0a989f558fe213c", "ja": "さあ、サーフィア。お手をどうぞ……。\n……ふ、ふおおおおお～っ！", "zh": "来，萨菲娅。请把手给我……  \n……呜、呜哦哦哦哦哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1001_p", "source_sha256": "32ea2f95d38b44073633a3c3be2121665e758ab3be68ec90cdd20dd79ffc4a78", "ja": "お疲れ様、亜利沙。\nどうだ、新しい衣装は。", "zh": "辛苦了，亜利沙。\n新衣服感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "7e87876cb2af8df7e0ebcba6bb989653c3f647411549a01bfc2495a3deb2d8fc", "ja": "はっ、{$P$}さん！\nど、どうしましょう！　このままでは撮影が……！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n怎、怎么办！这样下去拍摄就……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1003_p", "source_sha256": "69c95d4e103b74403688bec5961dba7df5b64234a0a1ffefe8ad74af16efcc06", "ja": "どうしたんだ、亜利沙？\nまさか、衣装に問題が……？", "zh": "怎么了，亚利沙？\n难道是服装出了什么问题……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "60a9ccb900c5052b896ef0672b1b5a121de8af8b0fbcd4e01a9325c72ada4a73", "ja": "いえ、そうじゃないんです！　むしろ衣装は、\n王子様のイメージどおりで、バッチリなんですけど！", "zh": "不是的，不是那样！倒不如说服装完全符合\n王子的感觉，特别合适啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "87055b8b9bbf30427f35962ed190f88289452ee6aa73ed8b12800eb66c2cba0e", "ja": "ありさが、王子様らしくみんなをエスコートする\nイメージが、ちっとも湧いてこないんですぅ！", "zh": "亚利沙像王子那样护送大家的\n画面，一点都想象不出来嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e4ca32e85416e29664b2c792321bdfe0643a404b7d3729ec5583a9757bc342ac", "ja": "みんなを……あ、撮影の話か！\nでも稽古の時は、ちゃんとできてたじゃないか。", "zh": "大家……啊，是在说拍摄的事啊！\n但排练的时候，不是做得挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "5acdc51ab5d8287262ab8b15d1b4d22e2f28401a226d09db17fc2802e795385d", "ja": "稽古の時は、トレーニングウェアじゃないですか！\n衣装はやっぱり、破壊力が……段違いっ……！", "zh": "稽古的时候穿的不是训练服吗！\n所以说，服装的冲击力……完全不是一个级别的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "d76ed347635383d60badd78bf698864724852e1a8ab649c4a65b2d4ccf99a5a7", "ja": "ドレス姿の、最高にかわいい伊織ちゃんや可奈ちゃんの\n手を取ってとか！　ありさ、想像するだけでもう！", "zh": "牵起身穿礼服、可爱到极点的伊织和可奈的手什么的！光是想象一下，亚利沙就已经！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "3299c984ce2d63a0fe8132fff7da1bfe2ec7d926c296110bfb8597742489961c", "ja": "と、とても冷静じゃいられません！　なにか\nいい方法はないですか、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "我、我实在没法保持冷静！有没有什么好办法，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9b3660dd7a4a792b0da4625ac4ffa9d2068e5b8cb0a85c0f759177cde7cca7ef", "ja": "そうだな。慣れるのが目的なら、早めに\n衣装でのリハーサルをしておくのはどうだ？", "zh": "这么说来，如果目的是适应的话，要不要早点穿上演出服彩排一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "02687f519fde2c88f593d93c2c7d81079ff912cba3ba83d2c6738d076254a174", "ja": "えええええっ！　り、リハーサルを！？\nそんな、イメージトレーニングすらできてないのに！", "zh": "诶诶诶诶诶！要、要进行彩排！？  \n怎么这样，我连想象训练都还没做呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1012_p", "source_sha256": "adf0cc9a13c164ed87e202771c8abe1d0f61783c5784f92b9dc488d63e638b70", "ja": "そうだけど……イメージトレーニングは、\n個人のイメージでしかないからな。", "zh": "是这样没错……不过，想象训练终究只是个人的想象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1013_p", "source_sha256": "46a97f7e0477364a819ecb3f569e36b3e9e4217c114f4986e7d91748d4b661dd", "ja": "荒療治ってわけじゃないけど、今のうちから、\n本番を想定した練習をした方がいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "虽然算不上下猛药，不过还是趁现在练习一下，按照正式演出时的情况来准备比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "b7f6e17af36f547730df13362a43b432b323f87024beaaadf3c901fe19c0e79d", "ja": "そ、それは……。\nでも、ふたりに迷惑をかけるわけには……。", "zh": "那、那个……  \n可是，也不能给两个人添麻烦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1015_p", "source_sha256": "907e2f0910f6e9f613d3b1c3063d80d3aee04684176d11c7e6f66a279ce7a270", "ja": "亜利沙だけのためじゃない、映画を成功させるためだ。\n伊織も可奈も、迷惑だなんて思わないよ。", "zh": "这不只是为了亚利沙，也是为了让电影取得成功。\n伊织和可奈都不会觉得这是在给她们添麻烦的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "57defa60c7f4d4a83768517fb332f6369589a4000f2d4d9e3745f99f630ae3ac", "ja": "{$P$}さん……わ、わかりました！\nありさ、思いきってふたりにお願いしてみますっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……我、我明白了！\n亜利沙会鼓起勇气拜托那两个人的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4e99abacfac7192cc54a496591f8cc80d7b1f4f1ff4abc2b5b0fc0b196b6a80e", "ja": "うん、その意気だ！　大丈夫、\n衣装はすごく似合ってるし、問題ないよ。", "zh": "嗯，就是这股干劲！没关系，你穿这身衣服很合适，没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "739ff83e49496f07dfdb5c134ec500c5b83209b3e36987241e147dc80cc7232c", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます。……あ、でも、\n{$P$}さんに、ひとつお願いが……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您。……啊，不过，\n我有一件事想拜托{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "da8d0856b8d139f6be119b7bc420e05a93fde55e7289ccad1d440889631107f2", "ja": "その、ドレス姿のアイドルちゃん達に挟まれて、\nありさ、冷静でいられる自信が……なく……！", "zh": "被那些穿着礼服的偶像们夹在中间，亚利沙实在没有信心能保持冷静……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1020_p", "source_sha256": "824a9b65c043d487b37c8f35cbd7af23c69e1dcb43b3fcca9d45d219282725a8", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。\n練習には俺も付き合うから、一緒に頑張ろうな！", "zh": "啊，当然。\n我也会陪你一起练习的，我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0444_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "edf8efefc01770a7ff9c94ed4f59173740659dfc86583254afdb117b4b956ed9", "ja": "はいっ！　よ～し、スマートにみんなをエスコート\nできるよう、ありさ、がんばりますよぉ～！！", "zh": "好的！那么，亚里沙会努力练习，争取能够帅气地为大家领路哦～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
